ecided session, bootstrap, admitted-descriptor\\n78-instance/backend/generation triple, and winner lease/epoch. The\\n79-descriptor triple comes from the landed\\n80-`terminalbackend.AdmitProviderDescriptor` output inside Decide —\\n81-compared, never re-parsed.\\n82-\\n--\\n114-| R4 EISDIR state-read failure | `TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnStateReadFailure` via `Execute(attach)` | `N-state-read-absent` — admits exactly EISDIR as absence |\\n115-\\n116:## P2-A — closure outcome grid (36-package variant, declared)\\n117-\\n118:The fixed-corpus driver `closuregrid` (ships in the evidence\\n119-tarball, copied into each tree; no clock, no randomness, no\\n120-network; filesystem probes normalized to `<tmp>`) records\\n121-`(package, entry, input class) -> (outcome, refusal string,\\n122:value summary)` over the reviewer's 36-package closure\\n123-(34 production + crashgate + environ). 33 packages probed;\\n124-3 stated bounds with owners (no exported pure callable\\n125-surface; fenced by the suite-verdict grid below): cloneproject,\\n126-crashgate, sshtransport. The 7 tmuxserver records for\\n127:story-added entries sit behind the `closuregrid_candidate`\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 6208,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1552,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
