us\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"reverse-transitive of direct-minus-scalar-environ: 32\\nmissing from audit-prod: ['hosttrust', 'localstore']\\nextra vs audit-prod: []\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 131,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 33,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
