ror, staging and non-receipt entries still skip. Kill path: the peer scan passes over the receipt directory instead of refusing the census.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-attach-peers-filename\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/overlap.go\",\n+        find='\\t\\tkeyed, found, err := store.Lookup(sessionID, instanceID, stem)\\n\\t\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\treturn nil, err\\n\\t\\t}\\n',\n+        replace='\\t\\tkeyed, found, err := store.Lookup(sessionID, instanceID, stem)\\n\\t\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\tcontinue\\n\\t\\t}\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAttachStorePeersRejectsFilenameMismatch\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the key-binding-failed peer past the census filename arm as a skip (a valid receipt misfiled under another client's name reads as no peer); undecodable files, foreign receipts, directories, and malformed stems still error, staging and non-receipt entries still skip. Kill path: the peer scan passes over the misfiled receipt instead of refusing the census.\",\n+    ),\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-2t4g7i/worktree/internal/termbind/mutant_harness.py","added":20,"removed":10},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
