ails closed). Proved by the two verbatim reviewer sequences plus reopen/replay/rotation-failure sequences and direct memory-forcing tests. Bound B40: lost rotation with a prior closure stays closed (one-bootstrap-per-session makes a fresh key unreachable; pinned mechanically); B41: the restore replay skip is structural (D-row, stated).\\n- P1-B: the wrapper join is one composed authorization over session, bootstrap, admitted-descriptor instance/backend/generation, and winner lease/epoch — each joined member with a divergence test and narrowing row; versions, holder, checkpoint, materialization, and prior binding are deliberately unjoined with namespace/owner reasons in the census. Both reviewer sequences verbatim.\\n- P2-B: R1 (0junk count), R2 ({} barrier key), R4 (EISDIR state read) witnessed with the reviewer plants as harness rows; R3 prober custody closed (cell B39→M), completing the custody symmetry.\\n- P2-A: fixed-corpus production-entry outcome grid over the 36-package closure (33 probed, 3 no-callable-surface bounds): 193 shared keys, zero moved, zero base-only, 7 declared candidate-only keys (story-added tmuxserver entries behind a build tag). Suite verdicts: 23,874 shared test keys, zero moved, 498 candidate-only additions all PASS. Found and fixed one grid flake (resumesmoke missing-member loop iterates a map; inputs now fail deterministically before it) and audited every member-naming error for fixed-order checks.\\n- P2-B prose: B27 19→18 U2c; no-real-socket sentence corrected (synthetic listener, not a tmux server). Census recomputed by script: 250 measured of 5064, 187 bound, 156 named undriven gaps; Table E 22 outcomes; harness 273/273 tmuxserver + 40/40 termbind.\\n- VALIDATION (exit 0, this run): gofmt; build + vet unix and windows; full suite both trees (45 ok each); race on both touched packages; cover (tmuxserver 88.0%, termbind 83.5%); no-tmux process audit clean; determinism 6/6 grid runs identical; harness 273/273 + 40/40 with one raw log per plant.\\n- STATUS: ready for review; worktree intentionally UNCOMMITTED for Story handoff snapshot. Results standalone + matrix + `TASK-260830-1c28dz_rework-evidence-rev5.tar.gz` attached to the board item.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 11323,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2831,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
