cle battery and its\\nraw per-plant logs attached to `TASK-260830-1c28dz`. The package adds\\nno `ax` command, no\\n===\\n LOGBOOK.md                               |   79 ++\\n README.md                                |   54 +-\\n internal/termbind/TRACEABILITY.md        |   18 +-\\n internal/termbind/mutant_harness.py      |   70 +\\n internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md      |  795 ++++++++++-\\n internal/tmuxserver/errors.go            |   11 +\\n internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py    | 2241 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\\n internal/tmuxserver/ownership_unix.go    |   12 +\\n internal/tmuxserver/ownership_windows.go |    7 +\\n 9 files changed, 3267 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1549,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 388,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
