{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e14d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ca08-6c63-7352-b762-5bc242c771c8"},"sequence":3841,"recorded_at":1780531400007677,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"cd8feb9b-6d69-49ce-a85c-818ca818e251","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"cd8feb9b-6d69-49ce-a85c-818ca818e251","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"cd8feb9b-6d69-49ce-a85c-818ca818e251"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ca31-eff2-7e72-b852-7434aedb75ff"},"task_id":"01a0ca31-eff2-7e72-b852-7434aedb75ff","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ca31-eff2-7e72-b852-7434aedb75ff","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 2419-2430\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-operation deadline and cancellation with no late commit, and\n-every read-only probe — the stop poll, the terminate confirm,\n-and the status probes — honors the same bound in-flight,\n-concluding unknown rather than a verdict when it fires. Attach\n-additionally fails closed on overlap: a second client that may\n-overlap a recorded peer needs multi_attach, and new input over a\n-recorded input peer needs multiple_input_clients, with\n-receipt-validated same-client retries exempt (a conflicting retry\n-still refuses idempotency_mismatch) and corrupt census entries\n-(a directory at a receipt-shaped name) refusing rather than\n-reading as no peers; client liveness is bound B44 in the\n-traceability map (owned by TASK-260922-vcx6yo).\n+operation deadline and cancellation with no late commit, and\n+every read-only probe honors its bound in-flight — the stop\n+pre-poll the graceful wait, the post-escalation re-confirmation\n+the operation deadline, the terminate confirm and the status\n+probes their deadlines — concluding unknown rather than a\n+verdict when it fires. Attach\n+additionally fails closed on overlap: a second client that may\n+overlap a recorded peer needs multi_attach, and new input over a\n+recorded input peer needs multiple_input_clients, with\n+receipt-validated same-client retries exempt (a conflicting retry\n+still refuses idempotency_mismatch) and corrupt census entries\n+(a directory at a receipt-shaped name, a receipt misfiled under\n+another client's key, a malformed receipt name) refusing rather\n+than reading as no peers; client liveness is bound B44 in the\n+traceability map (owned by TASK-260922-vcx6yo).\n","final_result":true}}}
